  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="27fbe214-9174-57e9-b8af-a8fa60e4ecde" activityNameId="461af35f-1f0d-5526-aa6d-18cccb6383bf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in industrial furnace, for asphalt production, 1MWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in industrial furnace, for asphalt production, 1MWth
The process “natural gas, burned in industrial furnace 1MWth/MJ/CH,” includes the fuel input from the Swiss natural gas network, the furnace infrastructure, emissions to air and water, and the electricity required for operation. The inventory is based on 1 MJ of natural gas burned in an industrial furnace with a capacity of 1 MW and 5,000 operating hours. 
UUID: 93e74dc7-ce61-4d0d-a6ac-e46edc0c4488
This dataset is based on the process “natural gas, burned in industrial furnace 1MWth/MJ/CH.” Compared to this reference process, the dataset does not include air emissions of fossil carbon monoxide, nitrogen oxides, and particulates &lt; 2.5 µm from the combustion of 1 MJ of natural gas, as these emissions are considered separately within the asphalt production processes.
Location: Europe
Technology: The process "natural gas, burned in industrial furnace 1MWth/MJ/CH" has been modified to generate a dataset that does not consider air emissions of fossil carbon monoxide, nitrogen oxides, and particulates &lt; 2.5 µm from the combustion of 1 MJ of natural gas in Switzerland.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_93e74dc7-ce61-4d0d-a6ac-e46edc0c4488.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
